# Generated client patch artifacts
client-patch/mpqtool
client-patch/StormLib/
client-patch/*.MPQ
client-patch/*.mpq
client-patch/out/
# The WoW folder install.bat remembers: one player's own path, not ours
client-patch/install_path.txt
# What update.py wrote down on a player's PC: the commit it fetched, the files
# it placed, and a wrapper waiting to be swapped in
client-patch/version.txt
client-patch/update_manifest.txt
client-patch/*.new
# The Python install.sh sets up for Pillow when the system's refuses pip --user
client-patch/.venv/

